{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Nidhogg brought him back.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:59:34.861000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870576343685955584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Yeah. Dragons Alllways think its funny to make people kobolds...\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:00:05.364000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T08:00:13.442000Z","id":"870576471624810496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Perfect for him, really. They like to cower and beg.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:00:33.019000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870576587618283561","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You know. This thing that I'm doing for you right now?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:01:00.651000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870576703515271188","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"This is what being a priest is like.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:01:09.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870576741951885323","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Just like, kinda talking people through the sloppy parts of life.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:01:30.002000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870576826622312448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"It just takes a little patience and kindness.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:01:47.303000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870576899187957781","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"And I work for that. Every day, I try to be patient and kind and good. I just learned today that I actually have a limit.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:03:34.756000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870577349878509628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Of course. Of course. But hitting a limit doesn't always mean wielding cosmic powers to be rid of a little pain. Talking about it is a better tool. Trust me. I've unable to do anything but talk for thousands of years.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:05:07.201000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T08:05:26.058000Z","id":"870577737620946974","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I mean, you're good at listening, too.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:06:58.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870578205751410738","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Thanks Irynx.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:08:42.329000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870578639933169684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I think the Ravens picked the right gal.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:09:03.555000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870578728961458218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"And I guess they have to pick another one, huh.\" She notes the puffkin resting in the grove.","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:10:26.318000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870579076094636055","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"It would be a good idea. Since you picked the last one too.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:10:55.857000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870579199990173696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"So what's going to happen to Speaker now that he broke his geas? Also, wasn't it a little general? He's just not allowed to talk about Nidhogg to anyone who knows my name? I think it was bound to come up in conversation!\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:14:45.050000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870580161295310908","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I mean. He's the one that freely offered himself to an underworld demigod. What a goofball.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:16:49.071000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870580681477079110","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"On one hand, I want to avoid Speaker for a long time. On the other, I want to talk to him right now to ask the entire thought process that led to making that *phenomenally bad decision*.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:21:26.610000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870581845560033311","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"It is wisdom to know that demanding information like that is a demand to punish him. A punishment that I think we both know is something that he will continue to seek out on his own. The thing about forgiveness, Priestess is that you have to first assign blame before you can then choose to let it go. The sort of powers that would wish you to seek vengeance upon speaker are the sort he now serves.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:26:01.435000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T08:26:56.762000Z","id":"870582998259605534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I don't think I want to forgive him. Not right now anyway. But you have made me realize I shouldn't forget either.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:36:09.455000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870585548480327730","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Thats ok. Protect yourself. Help who you can, and don't hurt yourself for anyone who you can't. I'm glad you let me talk to you about it. You sleeping in the grove tonight?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:39:39.965000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870586431423250453","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Maybe. I slept here almost all week when the ravens left. I'm kind of used to it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:43:35.145000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870587417839665184","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
